About footer concise (Made with ❤️ Panchi146) is consistent with upstream
practice for that interface, while complete legal terms and provenance are
provided in LICENSE and NOTICE files distributed with the application.

All supported packaging formats (Portable ZIP, Custom Installer, and NSIS)
are configured to provide LICENSE and NOTICE files upon deployment.

For binary distribution, distributors must make the complete Corresponding
Source for that exact Oryvia build available—including all modifications,
build/install scripts, and required assets—with equivalent access alongside the
